// Title: Group Membership Reconnaissance Via Whoami.EXE
// Rule ID: bd8b828d-0dca-48e1-8a63-8a58ecf2644f
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1033
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
